.TH MYSTRCPY 3 "September 2026" "Version 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcpy \- copy a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.PP
.BI "int mystrcpy(char *" dest ", const char *" src );
.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBmystrcpy\fR() function copies the string pointed to by \fIsrc\fR into \fIdest\fR.
